{"id":"steam-1357120","steam":1357120,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Block Me.","summary":"I am just a student testing steam. Do not expect much.","about":"I am an informationmanagement student. This arcade game was made from scratch, it is just to test how Steam works.\r\nDo not excpect much. You NEED at least Java 9! (You can just download it. Search for \"Java 9 Download Oracle\")\r\n\r\n----------------------------------------\r\nKeys are W/A/S/D to move and\r\nB to open and close the buymenu\r\n----------------------------------------\r\n\r\nGameplay:\r\nYou are a spaceship and you travel around the universe, you have to collect food\r\nwithout getting hurt by enemy Spaceships. Every once in a while,\r\nwhen you collected enough food, you can visit the alien-pawn-shop\r\nand trade for good spaceship upgrades.\r\n\r\nPls rate/comment the game.\r\nEverthing is programmed from scratch with Java.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1357120/library_600x900.jpg?t=1604678899","coverFallback":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1357120/header.jpg?t=1604678899","banner":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1357120/library_hero.jpg?t=1604678899","header":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1357120/header.jpg?t=1604678899","background":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1357120/page_bg_generated_v6b.jpg?t=1604678899","screenshots":[{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1357120/ss_f8f5ce3f8f129ebddd2fdbc0b7b9a69e7fb7b619.600x338.jpg?t=1604678899","full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1357120/ss_f8f5ce3f8f129ebddd2fdbc0b7b9a69e7fb7b619.jpg?t=1604678899"},{"thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1357120/ss_048439ffc0abff72e5538215e1827a5de3e2223e.600x338.jpg?t=1604678899","full":"https://shared.